  },
  "question": {
    "text": "The half life of a radioactive substance is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi></math>. The time taken, for disintegrating <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msup></math> part of its original mass will be:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>T</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>T</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mi>T</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>It is given that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>t</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>T</mi></math>.</p><p>After disintegration of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msup></math>part,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;part is only&nbsp;left.</p><p>Using the decay formula,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mfrac><mi>t</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></msub></mfrac></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mfrac><mi>t</mi><mi>T</mi></mfrac></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>ln</mi><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>t</mi><mi>T</mi></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>t</mi></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>T</mi></mstyle></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>T</mi></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
}